      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The heavy floral smell you're experiencing could be due to the release of VOCs (Volatile Organic Compounds) from the hydroponic system. You can try using Basic house filters (like a HEPA air purifier) or essential oil-free air fresheners specifically designed to address chemical fumes to reduce the odor. Another option is to purchase an outdoor air misting system with a built-in activated carbon filter to remove substances from the air before they reach your residence.",
      "source": "target",
