    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i was worried it wasn't just me noticing it. it feels like the misting is timed weirdly, almost like it's trying to catch me when i'm most vulnerable or something. do you think those VOCs could actually be concentrated enough to affect my mood or head space like that? it feels so intentional.",
